  "prefLabel": "Pda 702.02 Limited Applicability of Slip Permits for State-Owned Restricted Piers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 702.02 Limited Applicability of Slip Permits for State-Owned Restricted Piers. Any vessel with a slip permit issued under Pda 706 shall only be authorized to occupy a state-owned slip at a state-owned restricted pier.\n\nSource. #8845, eff 3-21-07; ss by #10949, eff 10-20-15; ss by #14376, eff 9-20-25, EXPIRES: 9-20-35",
